**/config/local.yaml
**/config/*.local.yaml
# NOTE: config/production.yaml is deliberately tracked (not ignored),
# matching the family's other services (person/worker/place/thing/
# event/course). It holds no secret directly — every credential is a
# Tera `{{ get_env(name="…") }}` call resolved from the environment at
# boot, never a literal value — so there is nothing here that needs to
# stay untracked. This crate's own loco scaffold ignored it by default
# (`**/config/production.yaml`, removed here); that meant the file
# never left this machine, so a boot-time bug in it (an unquoted empty
# SMTP Tera default rendering as YAML null instead of "") went
# uncaught and unfixed for every other checkout — see
# examples/compose/ (DEP-1) and this crate's own Dockerfile.

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# include cargo lock
!Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*

# Tantivy full-text index (`src/search/`). Derived from Postgres and
# rebuildable with `cargo loco task search_reindex`, so it is never
# committed. Default path is `./data/search-index`
# (`PROJECT_PORTFOLIO_MANAGEMENT_SEARCH_INDEX_PATH`).
/data/